       <item>
        <widget class="QLabel" name="label_max_iter">
         <property name="toolTip">
          <string>&lt;html&gt;&lt;head/&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,PingFang SC,Roboto,Ubuntu,Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,Hiragino Sans GB,Microsoft YaHei UI,Microsoft YaHei,Source Han Sans CN,sans-serif'; font-size:14px; font-weight:400; color:rgba(0,0,0,0.898039); background-color:#ffffff;&quot;&gt;算法&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,PingFang SC,Microsoft YaHei'; font-size:14px; color:rgba(0,0,0,0.898039);&quot;&gt;整体优化过程&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,PingFang SC,Roboto,Ubuntu,Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,Hiragino Sans GB,Microsoft YaHei UI,Microsoft YaHei,Source Han Sans CN,sans-serif'; font-size:14px; font-weight:400; color:rgba(0,0,0,0.898039); background-color:#ffffff;&quot;&gt;的最大迭代次数（外循环）。默认值常为100或1000。若模型未收敛可增大，如500或1000。确保优化过程有足够步骤收敛。设置过小可能提前停止；设置过大且&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,PingFang SC,Microsoft YaHei'; font-size:14px; font-weight:400; color:rgba(0,0,0,0.898039);&quot;&gt;tol&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,PingFang SC,Roboto,Ubuntu,Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,Hiragino Sans GB,Microsoft YaHei UI,Microsoft YaHei,Source Han Sans CN,sans-serif'; font-size:14px; font-weight:400; color:rgba(0,0,0,0.898039); background-color:#ffffff;&quot;&gt;不变时，可能增加不必要计算。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
         </property>
